learning/S010/index.html:22: trailing whitespace.
+    <section aria-labelledby="objective">
learning/S010/index.html:23: trailing whitespace.
+      <h2 id="objective">Objective and preconditions</h2>
learning/S010/index.html:24: trailing whitespace.
+      <p>Keep existing sessions and cart data valid while one stable cohort changes
learning/S010/index.html:25: trailing whitespace.
+        behavior and returns to standard behavior. Learn why flag reversal cannot
learning/S010/index.html:26: trailing whitespace.
+        repair an incompatible state schema or erase earlier failures.</p>
learning/S010/index.html:27: trailing whitespace.
+      <p>The deployed reader supports <strong>config v1 / state v1</strong>.
learning/S010/index.html:28: trailing whitespace.
+        Version 2 is a deliberate mismatch fixture. Four synthetic clients (two
learning/S010/index.html:29: trailing whitespace.
+        pilot, two control) start with one cart item. Each successful observed
learning/S010/index.html:30: trailing whitespace.
+        journey adds exactly one item. Events are deterministic, numbered, and
learning/S010/index.html:31: trailing whitespace.
+        bounded to 60 per run; there is no clock, randomness, or real telemetry.</p>
learning/S010/index.html:32: trailing whitespace.
+      <ol>
learning/S010/index.html:33: trailing whitespace.
+        <li>Observe the off baseline.</li>
learning/S010/index.html:34: trailing whitespace.
+        <li>Enable pilot with config v1, then observe all four journeys.</li>
learning/S010/index.html:35: trailing whitespace.
+        <li>Revert the flag to off, then observe again. Check the readable verdict.</li>
learning/S010/index.html:36: trailing whitespace.
+        <li>Try config v2, or inject state v2 after activation and observe. Reverse:
learning/S010/index.html:37: trailing whitespace.
+          earlier failures and incompatible state must remain visible.</li>
learning/S010/index.html:38: trailing whitespace.
+      </ol>
learning/S010/index.html:39: trailing whitespace.
+      <p><strong>No deployment migration is claimed.</strong> Even PASS means only
learning/S010/index.html:40: trailing whitespace.
